    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38274" root="مخج" body-key="m">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَخَجَ الدَّلْوَ</span></b> , (aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَخَجَ</span></b> , K, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَخْجٌ</span>, TA)
<i>He drew the bucket, and dashed it in the water,
in order that it might fill:</i> (Lh, S, K:) or
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَخَجَ الدَّلْوَ وَغَيْرَهَا</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَخَجَ بِهَا</span>, and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تمخّجها</span></b> ,
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تمخّج بِهَا</span>, and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تماخجها</span></b> , and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تماخج بها</span>,
<i>he agitated,</i> or <i>moved about, the bucket, &amp;c.</i>
(TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَخَجَ البِئْرَ</span> <i>He agitated the water of
the well violently:</i> and <i>he plied the well with the
large bucket.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  [Hence,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَخَجَ</span>, (aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَخَجَ</span></b> ,
inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَخْجٌ</span>, TA) <i>Inivit</i> feminam. (As, S, K.)

